  "releaseNotes": "DarkTextBox: add AllowNegative for Integer/Decimal input (including virtual-keyboard sign toggling) and ReserveVirtualKeyboardButtonSpace for aligned layouts. DarkIconButton: add configurable ContentPadding. DarkLedIndicator and DarkToggleSwitch: improve background rendering when hosted inside transparent containers. Previous release: add TextAlign to DarkTextBox; improve DarkButton rounded corners; add monitor-only output control; add HintText, multiline, and IPv4 modes; and improve dark-theme controls and virtual-keyboard behavior.",
